# Product principles

Primary: **right experience + right moment + right duration + right personality.**

- Finite experiences only — clear duration, immediate skip, easy return to code
- Never infinite scroll, endless feeds, or engagement-maximizing dark patterns
- Do not interrupt while the user is actively typing or in a forbidden context
- Local-first; no raw source or raw terminal history collected/persisted
- Existing celebrations/themes must not regress without an explicit migration plan
- Prefer the smallest change that preserves developer flow
